# App Home UI

- Entry: `extensions/app-home/src/AppHome.jsx` (`admin.app.home.render`).
- Share inbox state through `store.js`. Do not refetch on every page.
- Polaris web components only. Toast via `shopify.toast.show`.
- `s-text` subdued color is `color="subdued"`.
- Routes: `/`, `/task/:id`, `/weekly-review`, `/settings`.
- English UI copy. Keep screens simple; bundle size is tight.
- Sidekick tools in `extensions/app-tools` are read-only. Point merchants at App Home to edit tasks.
